  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe `site` job of `release.yml` run 45742430230 (tag v0.27.0) failed at \"Site tests\", so the 0.27.0 site was not deployed. `main` failed the same tests. This PR makes the guide agree with the shipped app again. Only `site/` files change, plus the decision record.\n\n- `site/static/icons/`: add `op-rotary-flow.png` and `tool-form-mill.png`, byte copies of `assets/ui/`. `LICENSES.txt` is now a byte copy of `assets/ui/LICENSES.md` again (it has the new Rotary Flow glyph note). The red icon test hid this third drift.\n- `operations-multiaxis.md`: a Rotary Flow section (use, picks, stated axis, settings and defaults, common refusals). The intro list names the kind.\n- `site/static/operation-paths.svg`: the Rotary Flow picture (view `RotaryFlow`).\n- `operations/_index.md`: Rotary Flow in the Multi-axis ribbon row.\n- `site/tests/test_operation_reference.py`: add `RotaryFlow` to `FAMILIES` (the test says \"Update the reference when OpType changes\").\n- `site/tests/test_first_4axis_part.py` and `test_first_continuous_4axis_part.py`: the `New tool…` label now points to `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tool_library_dialog/list.rs`. The old file `tool_library.rs` does not exist. The check is not weaker.\n- Decision: `docs/decisions/4106-site-tests.md`.\n\n## How tested\n\n- `python3 -m unittest discover -s site/tests` with zola 0.23.6 (the pinned release binary, sha256 checked), node 22.11.0 and `PYTHONUTF8=1`: 104 tests, OK. Before the fix: 4 failures and 2 errors, the same as the release run.\n- Pinned by `test_guide_icons.GuideIcons.test_component_static_icons_and_license_match_app`, `test_operation_reference.OperationReferencePictures.test_every_operation_has_section_and_picture`, `test_first_4axis_part.FirstFourAxisPart.test_each_bold_ui_label_is_a_string_in_its_source`, `test_first_continuous_4axis_part.FirstContinuousFourAxisProgram.test_each_bold_ui_label_is_a_string_in_its_source`.\n- The same site commit is on `site/v0.27.0` (from tag v0.27.0); the site tests pass there too.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- `cargo xtask catalog --check` was not run (it builds the app). The new section has the exact generated \"No catalog case yet.\" block, and no catalog case names Rotary Flow.\n- No Rust code changed, so there is no cargo gate.\n\nChangelog: none (docs only)\nEffort: high (issue effort:medium)\n\nFixes #4106\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
